Call [b]ADG_fnc_allowDamage[/b] with [b]false[/b] to disable damage for an entity in multiplayer. Pass [b]true[/b] to enable it again. The function can be called on the server or any client, not only where the entity is local.

The addon reapplies the selected state when ownership moves between the server, a client or a headless client. For example, a vehicle set to invulnerable stays invulnerable when a player gets in and takes ownership. Players who join later receive the current state. The addon starts automatically in every mission; no Eden module or CBA is needed. The server sends its scripts to connected and joining clients.

